  "content": "<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"width:124px;text-align:center\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/zipestudio.png?raw=true\">\n      </div>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/github.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fTalkingHeads\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/modrinth.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/TalkingHeads\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/curseforge.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fXmGF7rkkuY\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/discord.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fzipeleaf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/telegram.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fzipestudio%252ftip\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/support.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSdescription.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;描述&quot; 標題\"></p>\n<p><strong>Talking Heads</strong> 是一個客戶端外掛程式，可在玩家說話時放大玩家頭像。<br>\n與<strong>Plasmo Voice</strong>和<strong>Simple Voice Chat</strong>完全兼容，同時使用兩者皆可！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads/blob/master/img/showcase.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Talking Heads 標語&quot;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSsupport.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;支持&quot; 標題\"></p>\n<h3>想支持開發者和外掛程式？只需告訴大家這個外掛程式！</h3>\n<p>沒錯，只要進行宣傳就能很好地支持和推廣外掛程式及其創作者。知道這個外掛程式的人越多，下載量也會越高，這將為創作者提供動力並增加網站收入（實際上是自由捐贈）。<strong>請注意，宣傳不得具有侵入性和煩人！</strong></h3>\n<h3>你可以做什麼？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>製作視頻評論或廣告</li>\n<li>在社交媒體或 Discord 上分享</li>\n<li>告訴你的朋友有關這個外掛程式的事</li>\n<li>將其添加到你的外掛程式包中或直接下載並享受遊戲</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>每個提及都很重要 — 感謝你幫助社區成長 🤍</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSlicensing.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;授權&quot; 標題\"></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原始外掛程式儲存庫</a></h3>",
